WEBVTT

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.070
What is that?

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.520
A mermaid!

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:16.700
Now it's done!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:23.410
It got washed away, huh?

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:24.980
I'll make another one.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.670
Okay, let's make it together, then!

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:28.370
Yeah!

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:07.980
"Episode 15: A Summer That Won't Come Back"

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:10.040
Ten more minutes...

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:13.510
Takuya-<i>kun</i>, wake up!

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:18.430
Your friends are here!

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:21.950
Want to come inside and wait?

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:24.360
No, we'll wait here.

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:27.750
Sorry, I'll get ready right away!

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.170
Boss, hurry up!

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:32.850
Hurry up, or we'll be late for the train!

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.270
They're so loud again today...

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.840
Did you remember to bring suntan lotion?

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:45.470
Oh, and make sure you take insect spray.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:46.950
Thank you, Ayumi-<i>san</i>.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:48.650
Oh, right.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.150
Where'd you put the fever reducer?

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.480
The second drawer in the cupboard.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.940
Do you have a fever?

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:56.660
Just in case.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:01.280
Oh, you should probably
take some candles just in case.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.240
Yeah. I should probably
take a rope and a whip, too.

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.160
I can find them in your room, right?

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:08.810
Of course not!

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:11.470
Bye!

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.640
Oh wait, Takuya-<i>kun</i>.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:14.610
Here.

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:19.020
This belonged to Kodai-<i>san</i>.
It looks good on you.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.470
Okay, see you later.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:24.140
Have a good time!

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:25.420
Okay!

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:27.810
Three of them, huh?

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.350
I can't wait!

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:34.930
Hojo...

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.790
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.460
Hatano-<i>san</i>, you look so cute!

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.860
It's so weird to see you out of your uniform.

00:03:56.460 --> 00:04:00.270
Let's go. We'll be late for the train.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.720
"Erufu-Mochi"

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.600
Shimazu-<i>san</i>, try this!

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:13.100
It's addicting!

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.510
Oh, you can have some too
if you want, Hatano-<i>san</i>.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.900
Did we have to bring all this stuff, though?

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.330
It's all stuff we need for
a summer trip to the beach.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:26.910
We couldn't have blown up
the swim ring when we got there?

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.160
And we could've bought
a watermelon there, too.

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.620
If they only have pre-cut ones,
we won't be able to do watermelon-splitting!

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.080
Is it that important?

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:38.960
Shimazu-<i>san</i> says she's never done it!

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.800
Seriously? That's just
what you do in summer!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.130
Dad said I couldn't...

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.010
I see. A dignified young girl
like you can't be allowed

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.930
anywhere near something that barbaric, huh?

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:51.370
It's Shimazu-<i>san</i>'s first 
classic summer experience!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.060
I'll be with her every step of the way, too!

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.650
It's your first time too, right Kanna-<i>chan</i>?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.860
I'll be with you every step of the way...

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:03.440
I split watermelons once before.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.030
You did, huh?

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:10.450
It's hard to imagine you
swinging around a stick...

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:13.120
I think I'm better at it than most.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:20.170
When's our transfer...

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.920
We'll have to wait a while.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:22.760
Yeah.

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.760
Let's have some snacks, then!

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.010
Already?

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.970
He followed us all the way out here?

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.260
Is there something special about that guy?

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.690
He's following Kanna-<i>chan</i> around.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.850
Is he one of those "stalker" guys?

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:39.360
Are we supposed to call
the cops at a time like this?

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.870
Or let the station staff know?

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.770
Wait. I've got an idea.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.830
Nice package you've got there.

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.380
What's important is how hard it gets.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.880
You don't want to know
where Kodai Arima is?

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.150
You know?

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:08.340
Not me. Kanna knows.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.890
Try stealing her pendant, and then saying,

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:17.480
"If you want it back,
tell me where Kodai Arima is."

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.970
That's a stupid idea. Bye.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.940
H-Hey! Wait!

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.610
Argh, I can't stop!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:30.610
Where'd you go?

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.730
A-A watermelon?

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:54.010
You tricked me!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:57.890
That train runs nonstop 
to the end of the line.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.560
Never come back.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:00.760
My watermelon...

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:04.020
My "Masakatsu Presents" watermelon...

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.110
Don't get so down.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:07.790
We can buy one when we get there.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:11.780
Kanna-<i>chan</i>, you can use 
this straw hat instead.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.820
Thank you.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.400
It's huge!

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:03.120
Just in case, I have to ask.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:06.040
There's no shotgun-wielding
mayors inside, right?

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:09.840
Arima-<i>kun</i>, how did
you know my dad had a gun?

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:15.300
Um, I just kind of had a
feeling he'd be the kind of dad

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:17.790
who'd hunt any beast-like men
who got near his daughter.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:21.810
Don't worry. My dad's busy
with the city council right now.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.420
Now come inside.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.480
Excuse us!

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:27.820
Excuse me.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.440
I'm going upstairs to change.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:34.700
You boys find some place
to change on your own.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.120
Roger!

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:39.910
Let's go change, Boss!

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:40.680
Yeah.

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:43.620
Pervert!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.120
Why are you the one screaming?

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.540
Don't worry about me, please.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.220
Aww, it's not that easy...

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:54.420
I'll go upstairs too, then.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:03.350
Hatano-<i>san</i> is a little weird, huh?

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.550
Hojo's out there somewhere, too.

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.860
Just in case...

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.330
A private beach!

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:20.740
This is amazing!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.660
There's no need to be in such a hurry.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:24.540
The ocean's not going anywhere.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.630
Shimazu-<i>san</i>'s bikini...

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:34.850
Cute!

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.430
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.160
What were you expecting?

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:52.440
Okay, let's go have some fun!

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:53.710
Yeah!

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.840
What are you making?

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.590
A mermaid!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:20.750
Now it's done!

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:26.090
My mermaid!

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.760
It got washed away, huh?

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:32.660
Kanna-<i>chan</i>,

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:35.230
do you have an older sister or something?

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:38.450
No. I've always been alone.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.070
Alone? What about your family?

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.000
I don't have any.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:45.050
I used to live with my mother, but...

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.120
I see!

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.960
Boss!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:52.380
It's no good! They don't sell watermelons!

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.620
It's watermelon season, too...

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.960
They didn't have a whole one.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:00.470
And I was looking forward to Shimazu-<i>san</i>'s
first watermelon-splitting experience.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:03.100
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:13.890
Mistress...

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.970
Shall I lather your body with lotion?

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:18.890
No thanks.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:22.340
There's no telling what
you'd try and take a peek at.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:24.910
I'll lather you however you like.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.490
Stop doing that with your hands.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:31.870
I'm amazed your dad let us do this, though.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:34.370
The four of us getting
a whole villa to ourselves...

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:38.120
If he finds out, he'll bring that gun.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.590
If he finds out? Don't tell me...

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:43.900
I said I was staying with my girlfriends.

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.100
Did you really have to go that far?

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.190
It's not for your sake!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.600
Oh, right!

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:54.520
I have to get photos to 
show my dad for proof.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:55.840
Hatano-<i>san</i>!

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:57.470
Huh?

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.350
Where'd she go?

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:03.350
You two aren't going in the water?

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:05.380
I don't see Kanna-<i>chan</i>.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:09.630
Kanna-<i>chan</i>!

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:11.990
Hatano-<i>san</i>!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.410
Where'd she go, I wonder?

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.740
Let's split up and look.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:18.460
Hey!

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.030
Are you in here?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.330
Hatano-<i>san</i>?

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:29.220
Kanna-<i>chan</i>! Where did you--

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.440
Is something wrong?

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.310
A watermelon?

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:37.820
Where'd you get that?

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.070
There's a watermelon field down the road.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.190
The farmer gave me one.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:44.780
Hatano-<i>san</i>!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:48.330
Okay!

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:50.330
Let's get started!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.580
It's Shimazu-<i>san</i>'s first time!

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.080
Here I go!

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.630
I'm starting so far away?

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.670
And with a blindfold, too!

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:00.550
Hey!

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:02.490
And then you spin, too!

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.170
Now go ahead!

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:10.560
I don't know which way to go!

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.560
--Left! Go left! Left!
--Right! Your right! Right! No!

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:19.230
Which way is it?

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:26.720
--Right! Right! Right! Go right!
--Left! Left! Go straight ahead! Straight ahead!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.670
What you guys said is totally wrong!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:40.210
That's just how it goes on your first time!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.830
You do it next, Arima-<i>kun</i>!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.510
I used to be on the kendo team, you know!

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:48.360
Don't blame me if the
watermelon ends up pulverized.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.000
Okay, you can go last.

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:53.470
Hatano-<i>san</i>, you can go next!

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:55.280
All right, I will.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:03.120
I'll put on my blindfold.

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:04.810
Now I'll spin.

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:06.640
Here I go.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:13.410
--Right! Right! Right!
--Left! To your left!

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:15.520
Huh?

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.130
That was delicious.

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:32.510
Yeah.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:36.380
Um... Hatano-<i>san</i>?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.340
Thank you for getting that watermelon.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:42.770
It was nothing.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.320
Wait, Yuki!

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.630
Just try and catch me!

00:14:46.630 --> 00:14:50.020
Hey, do you want to go in the water too?

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:51.790
But...

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:54.200
Even if you can't swim, 
you can go in a little.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.390
It feels good.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.870
I didn't bring a bathing suit.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.880
I have an old one I keep here.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:02.670
You can wear it.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.090
She disappeared again.

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:17.560
Is something wrong?

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.940
That's perfect!

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:24.190
You might lose that pendant
if you take it in the water.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:25.050
Why not leave it here?

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:28.270
Okay.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:38.970
It's cold...

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:41.400
Don't force yourself to do
anything you don't want to.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.340
But it feels good.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.500
Let's all light fireworks after dinner!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:14.370
First, we need to eat.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.660
What's wrong?

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:18.770
My pendant...

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:22.030
I left it here!

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.980
Without it, I...

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:29.000
Huh? The meat for the BBQ is gone!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.020
The frankfurters, too!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:32.540
What's going on?

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.140
What was that sound?

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:43.980
Think the mayor came after us with shotgun?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:48.150
If that was my dad,
you and Yuki-<i>kun</i> would be dead by now.

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:49.720
Yeah.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:55.490
Huh?

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.260
What is this?

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:02.970
The Reflector Device is gone.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.420
Was it Hojo?

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:11.350
What's down there?

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:12.920
A basement.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.680
Yuki, come with me.

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:15.380
Right!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:17.010
Mio, you watch Kanna-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:17.700
Right.

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.560
Don't worry about a thing.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:23.820
We're all here for you.

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.790
So, he did it?

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.550
He went that way!

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:02.560
Are you okay?

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:03.390
I'm fine.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:04.420
What dog is this?

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:06.720
A wild dog. Get back.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:16.780
Watch out!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.170
I was looking forward to that barbeque...

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:35.030
We lost all our fireworks, too.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.380
So there's nothing for dinner?

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:40.000
I've got some instant ramen.

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:43.200
Our summer...

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:51.360
Nah. I won't.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:53.900
What are you talking about?

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:57.760
You only get one shot at youth, you know.

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.630
This summer will never come again.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.570
We only get one shot at 
it. That's why it's fun.

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.420
You got a tan, huh?

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:17.420
Yeah. The water stung a little.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:20.130
You should put some lotion on it.

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:24.340
Sit down. I'll do it for you.

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:32.510
A lot happened, but it was fun, huh?

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:35.870
It wasn't fun for you?

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:41.950
It's my first time having fun
with friends like this.

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:44.440
It was...

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:45.840
fun.

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:51.050
Let's all come back here next summer.

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:57.800
Yuki, don't push me!

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.470
Stop pushing me!

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:08.830
Oh no. More wild dogs?

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:23.490
Hey, what do you think
about Arima-<i>kun</i>, Hatano-<i>san</i>?

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:28.920
When he's around, my heart beats faster.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:31.490
I see.

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:35.620
The same thing happens
to me when I'm with him.

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:39.380
We're the same, huh?

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:41.010
Yes.

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:07.280
Oh? There's the frankfurter
I thought I'd lost...

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:08.830
Time to eat!

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:17.630
"Sakaimachi Station"

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.750
Okay, Boss.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.630
Shimazu-<i>san</i> and I are going this way.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.500
See you around, Arima-<i>kun</i>!

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:20.630
You too, Kanna-<i>chan</i>.

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.210
Okay, see you later.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:22.900
Bye!

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.140
It was a lot of fun.

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:36.000
Thanks for inviting me.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:38.650
Aww, it was nothing.

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:41.400
Anyway, want me to walk you home?

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.870
No, I'll be fine on my own.

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:45.720
Bye.

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:47.090
See you.

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:01.710
Kanna-<i>chan</i>!

